<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-15T02:54:01.135Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:54:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has seized three locations in West Kordofan and moved forward toward Al-Nahud, expanding its territorial gains. The Rapid Support Forces continue to employ drones, striking civilian areas in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile, and a Sudanese drone was shot down after crossing from Ethiopia. RSF forces killed ten civilians in An-Nuhud, while humanitarian aid is deteriorating, with food assistance cut for 900,000 people and social safety nets collapsing. The conflict has caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5RblFVX2d4Qnp5dDlhbUJHSGtBb0lNbHdBOUFIWGlONlJJalhzbVFTZ3Itc1JzWUNXdEloaWpYSVotSEllMmtsdTFsaWFTVHg2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBOWTE1alRLV2lvRVdXdGN2djhudk5HZThrMXhPcDg4eEJIS0dtVHdCNUZzNlNfaDVTSEswaVI5ODFuanBGbU92MTQ2b19fNG94SFQ2NWI4S0hDU2J4NTFsZDFqdDhweERmdkxDU1J3V1R3VGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5POS0xNFljVVFLRHhXMWJMQnZ0MEV0RHBZdTd4VW1nUF9xYTEtdGE1MjhLeFFiQUxJenkzTFVCeDdKbGZFT01aQ0E3YUxFV2wwaF9DNmRoSEpPOVNLRm9BTExDOXZKWG1pTGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNaHQ3OFN2Z0gxODlVcFExMkcyUGxyOFFJaFY3VWREVEJmSXFQcGFYVlQ3WUd6MTdKM